1. Definitions

"Commercial Use" means any use primarily intended for or directed toward commercial advantage or monetary compensation, whether direct or indirect. Commercial Use includes, for example, selling, licensing, sublicensing, paid consulting deliverables, charging subscription fees, charging one-time fees, usage in a paid product or paid service, ad-supported distribution, affiliate monetization, lead-generation use, sponsorship-backed use, or internal use by a business in support of revenue-generating activity.

"Commercial Algorithm Components" means only the code located in:

- src/lib/search/
- src/lib/deal-workflow/
- src/lib/trip-research/

"Restricted Components" means every other file, asset, route, interface, document, style, brand element, image, and code artifact in this repository that is not a Commercial Algorithm Component.

"Free Use" means use in a way that is made available at no charge to end users and is not monetized directly or indirectly.

